            <ArticleTitle>Echography in obstetrics and gynecological emergencies: the ectopic pregnancy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>343-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sonographic findings suggestive of ectopic pregnancy in 23 patients are reported by the Authors. In accordance with the data from the literature the real time sonography has shown in this study a diagnostic accuracy of 76%.</AbstractText>
